  "description": "Ribbon Command Studio helps makers and developers inspect, edit, validate, preview, and export Dataverse and Dynamics 365 RibbonDiffXml from solution packages. It supports custom ribbon buttons, command definitions, display rules, enable rules, JavaScript actions, XML formatting, and solution export in an XML-first workflow.",
