  "published": "2026-06-23T08:23:34.697Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial public release of Ribbon Command Studio.\n\nFeatures included:\n- Import Dataverse/Dynamics 365 solution zip files.\n- Parse and preview RibbonDiffXml buttons by ribbon area.\n- Add, edit, delete, and reorder custom ribbon buttons.\n- Edit and validate full RibbonDiffXml before applying changes.\n- Format XML before export.\n- Search JavaScript web resources and function names to help configure command actions and rules.\n- Export updated solution packages with incremented solution version.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "An XrmToolBox plugin for safely editing and validating Dataverse/Dynamics 365 RibbonDiffXml.",
